    "created_at": "2025-07-30T20:45:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-30T20:45:51Z",
    "body": "> (Aside: using 4xf32 instead of 4xf16 to store a color seems overly excessive.)\n\nI agree, and [so does CSS color 4](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color-4/#serializing-color-function-values) which has a table of the minimum precision for round-tripping; the largest value in that table is 16. It also states\n\n> (16bit, half-float, or float per component is recommended for internal storage).",
